<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
    <tr valign="top" height="400" >
        <td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
            <![CDATA[
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 14.95px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Hi&nbsp;</span>{!Contact.NSP_Preferred_First_Name__c},
                </p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="color: red;"><br></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">The
                        annual benefits open enrollment is upon us.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><br></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">To
                        properly configure the isolved system, we need to partner with you to gather specific information after you
                        approve the renewal from your broker. Most of this information is contained in the Benefit Summary Plan
                        document.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><br></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Based
                        on our records, your benefits plan year begins on&nbsp;<span style="color: red;">{Benefits Renewal Date}</span>.
                        Please advise whether the isolved open enrollment portal is needed or if an admin will enter the benefits.<o:p>
                        </o:p></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><br></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Below
                        is the information that I will need from you as soon as possible but no later than 14 days before your open
                        enrollment period; a delay in receiving this information in full can shorten the amount of time isolved can be
                        used for Open Enrollment:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <ul type="disc" style="">
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Most importantly, Preferred Start and Stop dates
                            for your open enrollment portal<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Rates – We need the rates associated with each plan
                            and coverage level<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Contribution Strategy – percent or flat rate
                            employer is offering towards Employee Only monthly coverage and contribution strategy for all dependent cost
                            <o:p></o:p></span></li>
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">For new offerings: Plan Type – (Medical, Dental,
                            Vision, Employee Life… etc.), new Eligibility Rule criteria – (FT, Active, Salary, Hourly… etc.)<o:p></o:p>
                            </span></li>
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Correspondence – Documents, forms, links, or
                            summary of benefits for employees to access as they navigate through the portal<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Preferred Plan Name(s) - Employees will see this
                            and need to understand what it is<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Updated group structures for EDI file feed mapping
                            if applicable<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                </ul>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">&nbsp;
                        <o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">I
                        would be happy to schedule a call and answer any questions about the open enrollment checklist. Please let me
                        know your availability, and I will schedule a time for us.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><br></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Thanks
                        for your attention.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><br></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">&nbsp;<b>Note:</b>
                        <o:p></o:p>
                    </span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                        style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><b><br></b></span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 18.4px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">If you
                        have monthly rate overrides, these must be manually adjusted before the first paycheck of the new plan year.
                        <o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <ul type="disc" style="">
                    <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span
                            style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">The weekly carrier feeds will be paused beginning
                            with the start of your open enrollment period through the remainder of the plan year. Please update all
                            non-open enrollment eligibility changes that are entered into isolved directly with your broker or
                            carrier.</span></li>
                </ul>
                <div style=""><br>
                    <font size="2"><br></font>
                </div>
            ]]>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>